  "limitations": [
    "OPTIONAL TEMPLATE; no physical measurements have been performed or validated by this plan.",
    "Schedule a rig session and review exposure, frame rate, fixture, projector settings and citations before use. The 100 ms exposure is a starting value, not a measured safe setting.",
    "Keep the probe fixed across the five consecutive conditions at each receiver; placement confirmations do not require moving it. Move only when the receiver changes.",
    "16 source-to-receiver conditions plus 4 all-on controls. Each condition has three white acquisitions, start/end drift references, and an automatically paired all-black capture at every exposure used.",
    "Ten scans per acquisition quantify short-term repeatability only. Repeats at a held position do not estimate repositioning error. Repeat the whole block in a separate rig-approved run to assess drift/order and placement.",
    "Black background is necessary: illuminated gaps would be an additional unmeasured source. Projector-black is a baseline, not projector-off darkness.",
    "Measures detector response at arena centres for white at this domain and drive; it does not calibrate whole-arena irradiance or identify every nonlinear interaction."
  ]
